    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d311-a76">

                <pb facs="0714" n="630" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg630"/>

                <p>On the same date it is certified that these proceedings being completed, they are
                    delivered to Adjutant, Maj. Francisco J. Boza, their being twenty-four folios
                    manuscript.</p>
                <closer><signed>RUBIO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>A true copy.</p>
                    <closer><signed>EDUARDO GARAY,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Chief
                            Clerk.</hi></signed>
                        <lb/>
                        <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                    >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                                ana="#date_imprecise-inferred-from-date-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                                notAfter="1886-04-30" notBefore="1886-04-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >April</hi>, 1886</date>.</dateline></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
